== Walkthrough ==

[[Image:ogreheadsmap.png|thumb|Helpful Map]]

{{expand}}
''' ''Please fill in the missing dialog that begins this quest.  Unsure of a lead in from another quest.  As a Wood Elf Ranger with Warmly faction, Byzar only offers the [[Runnyeye Warbeads (Kaladim Warrior)]] quest when hailed'' '''

<br>

After completing [[The Mudtoes]] the quest giver [[Furtog Ogrebane]] will give you the lead to start this quest. However, you might want to do this quest first, as these ogres are quite a bit lower level than the ones Furtog sends you after.


''[[Byzar Bloodforge]] is located at -108, 381, 3 or -38, 400, 3 as he paths between two rooms in the Kaladim Warrior's Guild.''


You say, 'What about Corflunk' 


: Byzar Bloodforge says, 'Do not speak the names of Zarchoomi and Corflunk!! I have heard enough of those ogres!! I would pay greatly for their heads!!'

''Upon the death of [[Corflunk]]''

<div class="facblock">
