* Your faction standing with [[Craknek Warriors]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Green Blood Knights]] got better.
</div>

''Upon the death of [[Zarchoomi]]''

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Shamen of War]] got worse.
</div>

Zarchoomi says, 'Your destiny lies at the hands of the Greenbloods.'

'''Hand [[Byzar Bloodforge]] the [[Ogre Head]]s looted from [[Corflunk]] and [[Zarchoomi]].'''

: Byzar Bloodforge says, 'I underestimated you. You are truly a great warrior. I reward you with a piece of my own Bloodforge armor. You would be fine Bloodforge Brigade material! How would you like to [take a little trip] in the name of the Bloodforge Brigade?'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Storm Guard]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Kazon Stormhammer]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Miners Guild 249]] got better.
